    {
      "exercise": "821",
      "grading": "ungraded",
      "source": "derived",
      "displayAnswer": "a) $\\sqrt{6}$；b) $2\\sqrt{5}$；c) $-\\sqrt{3}$；d) $-\\sqrt{11}$；e) $10\\sqrt{2}$；f) $-6\\sqrt{2}$。\n原式前的负号保留在根号外。例如 $-0.05\\sqrt{28800}=-0.05\\times120\\sqrt{2}=-6\\sqrt{2}$。",
